.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop \- An implementation of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using sqop 0.38.0
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
An implementation of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using sqop 0.38.0
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sqop\-version(1)
Prints version information
.TP
sqop\-list\-profiles(1)
Emits a list of profiles supported by the identified subcommand
.TP
sqop\-generate\-key(1)
Generates a Secret Key
.TP
sqop\-change\-key\-password(1)
Updates a key\*(Aqs password
.TP
sqop\-revoke\-key(1)
Creates a Revocation Certificate
.TP
sqop\-extract\-cert(1)
Extracts a Certificate from a Secret Key
.TP
sqop\-update\-key(1)
Keep a Secret Key Up\-To\-Date
.TP
sqop\-merge\-certs(1)
Merge OpenPGP Certificates
.TP
sqop\-certify\-userid(1)
Certify OpenPGP Certificate User IDs
.TP
sqop\-validate\-userid(1)
Validate a User ID in an OpenPGP Certificate
.TP
sqop\-sign(1)
Creates Detached Signatures
.TP
sqop\-verify(1)
Verifies Detached Signatures
.TP
sqop\-encrypt(1)
Encrypts a Message
.TP
sqop\-decrypt(1)
Decrypts a Message
.TP
sqop\-inline\-detach(1)
Splits Signatures from an Inline\-Signed Message
.TP
sqop\-inline\-verify(1)
Verifies Inline\-Signed Messages
.TP
sqop\-inline\-sign(1)
Creates Inline\-Signed Messages
.TP
sqop\-armor(1)
Converts binary OpenPGP data to ASCII
.TP
sqop\-dearmor(1)
Converts ASCII OpenPGP data to binary
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.38.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Sequoia PGP
